OL,3,GNEWSACall for better laws after rise in
OL,4,Ae-scooter crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore people have been reported as badly
OL,7,Fhurt in crashes involving e-scooters
OL,8,Fand e-bikes this year, Essex Police
OL,9,Fsaid, as it called for better
OL,10,Fregulations.
OL,12,FRoads policing chief Adam Pipe from the
OL,13,Fforce said, "39 people have been
OL,14,Fseriously injured as a result of either
OL,15,Fan e-scooter or e-bike collision" in
OL,16,Fthe county so far, compared to 32
OL,17,Fincidents in total last year.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
