OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall for better laws after rise in
OL,4,Ae-scooter crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have been promised these
OL,7,F[regulations] consecutively by
OL,8,Fgovernments coming into power, but
OL,9,Funfortunately, it keeps being kicked
OL,10,Fdown the line," he said.
OL,12,FUp to 1.2 million people in England are
OL,13,Festimated to own private e-scooters,
OL,14,Fwhich are illegal to ride on public
OL,15,Fstreets.
